y (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"O00192","text":"Contributes to the regulation of alternative splicing of pre-mRNAs."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}